    <tags>independesk virtual-desktop multi-monitor desktop productivity workspace</tags>
    <summary>Independent virtual desktops per monitor for Windows</summary>
    <description>
IndepenDesk brings macOS-style "Displays have separate Spaces" behavior to Windows: every monitor gets its own set of virtual desktops, and switching only affects the monitor under the mouse cursor.

## Features

- Per-monitor desktops with independent, dynamic desktop counts (up to 9 per monitor)
- Global desktop numbering with `Ctrl+Alt+1..9` jumps
- Compact on-screen desktop indicator after every switch
- Mission Control-like overview (`Ctrl+Alt+Up`) with drag and drop
- 8 UI languages, auto-detected
- Starts with Windows by default — can be turned off from the tray menu
- Crash-safe: hidden windows are journaled and restored on the next start
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/prcyangli/IndepenDesk/releases/tag/v0.4.1</releaseNotes>
